          "text": "如果在 Workerman 的 onMessage 里写了原生 sleep(1)"
        },
        {
          "startSec": 5.479,
          "endSec": 9.47,
          "text": "全进程一万个连接同时卡死一秒钟！怎么写出只睡当前请求"
        },
        {
          "startSec": 9.47,
          "endSec": 13.076,
          "text": "绝不卡住别人家的 Coroutine::sleep()？"
        },
        {
          "startSec": 13.076,
          "endSec": 19.078,
          "text": "只需要把第 1 篇写过的 EventLoop::delay() 和今天学的 Fiber 接在一起！"
        }
      ]
    },
    "shot-02-sleep-impl": {
      "id": "shot-02-sleep-impl",
      "audioFile": "audio/ep079/shot-02-sleep-impl.mp3",
